8.	Python program to add two matrix using array and function.

Source Code:

def add_matrix(A, B):
    return [[A[i][j] + B[i][j] for j in range(2)] for i in range(2)]

A = [[2, 3], [4, 5]]
B = [[6, 7], [8, 9]]

X = add_matrix(A, B)

print("Result:")
for row in X:
    print(row)

